msgstr "線路格式是跑在 WebSocket 上的 Protobuf。以下是 `test/smoke_v2.py` 使用的慣用寫法："

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:114 9f2f84fa884349558c0470f11c171748
msgid ""
"The session holds the live QuantLib graph. `update_market` writes quotes "
"and reprices off the same objects; anything that changes graph "
"*structure* — a new curve shape, a new index — is a new session."
msgstr ""
"工作階段持有即時的 QuantLib 物件圖。`update_market` "
"寫入報價，並以同一批物件重新計價；任何會改變物件圖*結構*的東西——新的曲線形狀、新的利率指標——都要開新的工作階段。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:118 b530e866bb6542e895635852c16fdc57
msgid ""
"An update is checked before it writes anything: an unknown quote or index"
" is `UNKNOWN_ID` on `quotes[i].quote_id` or `fixings[i].index_id`, and "
"the session is untouched. A `force_rebootstrap` that fails does so after "
"the writes, so the update is refused and the session is rebuilt from its "
"log without it."
msgstr ""
"更新在寫入任何東西之前先經過檢查：未知的報價或利率指標會在 `quotes[i].quote_id` 或 "
"`fixings[i].index_id` 上得到 `UNKNOWN_ID`，工作階段不受影響。失敗的 `force_rebootstrap` "
"發生在寫入之後，所以這筆更新會被拒絕，工作階段則從它的日誌重建，不含這筆更新。"

