#: ../../HANDLERS.md:185 b8f00f0cc5924bb4a603d54d86c22b78
msgid ""
"Frozen means the values must be `Number.fixed`, as on an interpolated "
"curve. A `variance_surface` interpolates bilinearly, extends across "
"strikes by its interpolator and does not extend past its last expiry; any"
" other `interpolator`, `strike_extrapolation` or `time_extrapolation` is "
"`UNSUPPORTED`."
msgstr ""
"凍結的意思是數值必須是 `Number.fixed`，和內插曲線一樣。`variance_surface` "
"以雙線性內插，在履約價方向以其內插器延伸，且不會延伸到最後一個到期日之後；任何其他的 "
"`interpolator`、`strike_extrapolation` 或 `time_extrapolation` 都是 "
"`UNSUPPORTED`。"

