#: ../../HANDLERS.md:393 156fb56264dc47febc9d45dd68c51759
msgid ""
"`Engine.model` is carried but only `MODEL_BLACK_SCHOLES` is built, since "
"Heston, Bates and local vol are not. Any other model is `UNSUPPORTED` "
"rather than priced Black-Scholes under its name."
msgstr ""
"`Engine.model` 會被帶著，但只有 `MODEL_BLACK_SCHOLES` 有實作，因為 Heston、Bates "
"與局部波動率都沒有。其他任何模型都是 `UNSUPPORTED`，而不是頂著它的名字以 Black-Scholes 計價。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:397 c4b3292bb1c5423aa56f391ecc300981
msgid ""
"**American approximations.** QuantLib has three and they disagree in the "
"third decimal, so the client names one rather than inheriting a default: "
"`BARONE_ADESI_WHALEY`, `BJERKSUND_STENSLAND`, `JU_QUADRATIC`. Omitting it"
" is `UNSPECIFIED_ENUM` on `engine.analytic.approximation`."
msgstr ""
"**美式近似法**。QuantLib "
"有三種，而它們在小數點後第三位就不一致，所以由用戶端指名一種，而不是繼承預設值：`BARONE_ADESI_WHALEY`、`BJERKSUND_STENSLAND`、`JU_QUADRATIC`。省略它會在"
" `engine.analytic.approximation` 上得到 `UNSPECIFIED_ENUM`。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:402 7cb318e0c00747aebb71e5c9ed011eb0
msgid ""
"**Lattice trees.** Seven compile for a vanilla — `COX_ROSS_RUBINSTEIN`, "
"`JARROW_RUDD`, `ADDITIVE_EQUIPROBABILITIES`, `TRIGEORGIS`, `TIAN`, "
"`LEISEN_REIMER`, `JOSHI4`. A barrier takes `COX_ROSS_RUBINSTEIN` only."
msgstr ""
"**格點樹**。一般型編譯了七種——`COX_ROSS_RUBINSTEIN`、`JARROW_RUDD`、`ADDITIVE_EQUIPROBABILITIES`、`TRIGEORGIS`、`TIAN`、`LEISEN_REIMER`、`JOSHI4`。障礙只接受"
" `COX_ROSS_RUBINSTEIN`。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:406 87b2c5a719da403ea5f6960147e922b8
msgid ""
"**Finite difference.** `preset` is `COARSE` (100×100), `STANDARD` "
"(400×200) or `FINE` (2000×800), each of them Douglas with no damping. "
"`custom` — explicit `time_steps`, `asset_steps`, `damping_steps` and "
"`scheme` — works on the plain paths and is `UNSUPPORTED` under quanto. "
"All four fields are read: a custom grid that named a scheme and got "
"Douglas anyway would be a defect rather than a simplification."
msgstr ""
"**有限差分。**`preset` 是 `COARSE`（100×100）、`STANDARD`（400×200）或 "
"`FINE`（2000×800），每一個都是不帶阻尼的 Douglas。`custom`——明確指定 "
"`time_steps`、`asset_steps`、`damping_steps` 與 `scheme`——在一般路徑上可用，在 quanto "
"之下則是 `UNSUPPORTED`。這四個欄位都會被讀取：一個指名了某種差分格式、結果卻還是拿到 Douglas 的自訂網格，是缺陷而不是簡化。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:413 07310aefdcba4f0f80d09ef7ddec190c
msgid ""
"`scheme` has no default, for the reason the grid has none: two schemes "
"are two prices for one trade. Five of the six arms build."
msgstr "`scheme` 沒有預設值，理由和網格沒有預設值一樣：兩種差分格式就是同一筆交易的兩個價格。六個分支中實作了五個。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 5181f9351d1b4990bb4f4e65db9484cb
msgid "`Scheme`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 81502b27e2f34291bb52bd95d54c04cd
msgid "What it is here"
msgstr "在這裡是什麼"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md bcc1bf8bfb13425ba52e7b96896dc07d
msgid "`DOUGLAS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md a2e7ba0d49824cc2acfda59d6d4ea654
msgid "QuantLib's own default, second order. What to send with no opinion"
msgstr "QuantLib 自己的預設值，二階。沒有特別偏好時就送這個"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 49f1c6bdd27e4817881a32265ec6d69e
msgid "`CRANK_NICOLSON`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md eed201c3a1fd41e59e4e9887bd8b1654
msgid "Douglas to within a bit in one dimension"
msgstr "在一維下與 Douglas 只差一點點"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 3309e077bb354ed8bb2938ed0622932a
msgid "`CRAIG_SNEYD`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 2ab52d7639ab4f249f63869f15a91dc7
msgid "Douglas *exactly* in one dimension — there are no directions to alternate"
msgstr "在一維下與 Douglas *完全相同*——沒有方向可以交替"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 8ba0d684ff9d42f4a3a50ee0c0e97cc8
msgid "`HUNDSDORFER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md f3f22086b9d34ffbb875a9b2cd96dc55
msgid "A different theta; differs from Douglas in the seventh digit"
msgstr "不同的 theta；與 Douglas 在第七位數才有差異"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 0eda16642f184e8986f9266fe5220952
msgid "`IMPLICIT_EULER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 8772353019e748c9ab5fecd442b6ae9c
msgid "First order, unconditionally stable; differs in the third digit"
msgstr "一階，無條件穩定；在第三位數字就有差異"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md adbf2cb6329e4826b65d45b0ec43b13d
msgid "`EXPLICIT_EULER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md f93d2d3c43944e6f8c1031a76bff51f2
msgid "`UNSUPPORTED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:425 336f4a5d33c842f5b663e37a8828e50c
msgid ""
"Explicit Euler is refused rather than offered because it is stable only "
"while the time step is small against the square of the asset step, and "
"the asset step belongs to a mesher QuantLib builds inside the engine "
"rather than to anything on the frame. An unstable run does not fail: at "
"100×200 this build answered 2.4e140 and at 400×200 a NaN. Implicit Euler "
"is first order too, with no such condition."
msgstr ""
"顯式 Euler 被拒絕而不提供，因為它只有在時間步長相對於資產步長的平方夠小時才穩定，而資產步長屬於 QuantLib "
"在引擎內部建構的網格產生器，不屬於訊框上的任何東西。不穩定的計算並不會失敗：在 100×200 時這個建置回答了 2.4e140，在 "
"400×200 時則是 NaN。隱式 Euler 同樣是一階，但沒有這樣的條件。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:432 075d530d67a94544bce460faa0360678
msgid ""
"`damping_steps` are Rannacher's fix for the oscillation a Crank-Nicolson-"
"family scheme shows against a kinked payoff or a barrier — fully implicit"
" steps taken first. They run in addition to `time_steps`, not out of "
"them, and are held to the same limit."
msgstr ""
"`damping_steps` 是 Rannacher 針對 Crank-Nicolson "
"家族格式在折角收益函數或障礙附近出現震盪所提出的修正——先走的幾步採完全隱式。它們是在 `time_steps` "
"之外另加的，不是從中扣出，並受同樣的上限約束。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:437 a9132f4bca6a41f19551dfa0fa60ec7d
msgid ""
"**Monte Carlo.** `seed` must be non-zero, because QuantLib otherwise "
"seeds from the clock and the same inputs would price differently on every"
" request. Give `samples` or `absolute_tolerance`, not both. Setting "
"`progress_every_paths` switches to the batched path, which is what emits "
"`Progress` frames and what lets a cancel stop the work rather than only "
"the waiting — and it **changes the answer**, because batches draw from "
"the RNG stream differently from one run of the same total. "
"Reproducibility keys on `(seed, samples, progress_every_paths)`, which is"
" why `PriceResult` echoes the whole `Engine` message back."
msgstr ""
"**蒙地卡羅。**`seed` 必須非零，因為否則 QuantLib 會以時鐘作為種子，同樣的輸入在每次請求都會算出不同的價格。給 "
"`samples` 或 `absolute_tolerance`，不要兩者都給。設定 `progress_every_paths` "
"會切換到分批路徑，那正是送出 `Progress` "
"訊框、並讓取消真正停下工作而不只是停下等待的東西——而且它**會改變答案**，因為分批從亂數串流中取樣的方式，和總數相同的單次計算不一樣。可重現性取決於"
" `(seed, samples, progress_every_paths)`，這也是為什麼 `PriceResult` 會把整個 "
"`Engine` 訊息回傳。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:447 9e655e9c3ce242e392473ce190733a20
msgid ""
"Every path draws pseudo-random numbers, so `RNG_LOW_DISCREPANCY` is "
"`UNSUPPORTED`. The three variance-reduction switches are read where the "
"engine takes them and `UNSUPPORTED` elsewhere, since the echo would "
"otherwise report a technique that was never applied:"
msgstr ""
"每條路徑都抽取偽亂數，所以 `RNG_LOW_DISCREPANCY` 是 "
"`UNSUPPORTED`。三個變異數縮減開關只在引擎接受它們的地方被讀取，其他地方則是 "
"`UNSUPPORTED`，否則回傳的內容會宣稱用了一種從未套用的技巧："

