#: ../../HANDLERS.md:839 b467d3c152484c71a578efb44a56cb1c
msgid ""
"The three that a frontend must tell apart are `UNSPECIFIED_ENUM` (you "
"left a field out), `INVALID_ARGUMENT` (you filled it in wrongly) and "
"`UNSUPPORTED` (the request is well-formed and this build refuses to price"
" it on a substitute)."
msgstr ""
