"`UNSUPPORTED`（請求格式正確，而這個建置拒絕拿替代品為它計價）。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:844 a33eca76d0ea455b8a4f3b5a88921126
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "驗證"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:846 91aeb177dd0848738a54146f635596eb
msgid ""
"Every handler above is exercised by `test/smoke_v2.py`, which drives a "
"running `ql-backend` over a real WebSocket: 369 rows of QuantLib's own "
"reference values plus the rejection cases, 145 checks in all. [Smoke "
"tests](TESTING.md) explains how to run it, and [the quanto barrier "
"benchmark](BENCHMARK.md) is the analytic-vs-PDE cross-check."
msgstr ""
"以上每個處理常式都由 `test/smoke_v2.py` 實際演練過，它透過真正的 WebSocket 驅動執行中的 `ql-"
"backend`：369 列 QuantLib 自己的參考值，加上各種拒絕情況，共 145 "
"項檢查。[冒煙測試](TESTING.md)說明如何執行它，而 [quanto 障礙選擇權基準測試](BENCHMARK.md)則是解析解對 "
"PDE 的交叉驗證。"

